sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant API as FastAPI / Streamlit
  participant N as Normalizer
  participant F as Feature Extractor
  participant T as Aura Templates
  participant D as Structural Delta
  participant M as Ensemble Model
  participant X as Explainer
  U->>API: Submit query
  API->>N: Canonicalize query
  N-->>API: Normalized query and tokens
  API->>F: Extract semantic features
  API->>T: Match legitimate templates
  T-->>D: Best template and token sequence
  API->>D: Compute structural delta
  API->>M: Predict using fused features
  M-->>X: Score and component contributions
  X-->>API: Reasons and influential features
  API-->>U: Decision, confidence, threat level

